sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as DownloadsRepository
    participant Srv as Server (entitlement, Ch 19/23)
    participant Helper as DownloadHelper
    participant DM as Media3 DownloadManager + DownloadService (FGS, Ch 46)
    participant Lic as License server
    participant SSOT as Room (Ch 3)

    User->>Repo: download(title, 720p)
    Repo->>Srv: authorize download (entitled? within limits?)
    Srv-->>Repo: ok
    Repo->>Helper: select 720p track + audio/subtitle from manifest
    Helper->>DM: enqueue download (Wi-Fi-only, Ch 47)
    DM->>SSOT: state=downloading, progress updates
    DM->>Lic: acquire offline Widevine license (authed) + expiry
    Lic-->>DM: offline license stored securely (Ch 25)
    DM->>SSOT: state=completed, licenseExpiry set
